      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRINDLE ROAD (8) has been in the minor money at both career runs, the latest finishing third (24.32) at Bendigo. Looks the one to beat this time. PACIFIER (1) out of the placings last few but draws down on the inside. Last time finished 4th in a Maiden on August 2 over 350m at Healesville behind Wild Orange beaten 3.5 lengths (19.64). Cannot be taken lightly. MR. BOJANGLES (4) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 6 lengths behind True Agent in 22.81 and recording a new PB here. Bold showing expected again. QUENA LULLABY (2) is new to this course but not to be underestimated. Something for the Multiples: MR. BOJANGLES (4)",
